<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Welcome to Daan</title>

    <style>
      body {
        font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
        background: #f7f7f7;
        color: #333;
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
      }

      .container {
        max-width: 500px;
        margin: 40px auto;
        background: #fff;
        padding: 30px;
        border-radius: 8px;
        box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
        text-align: center;
      }

      .logo {
        font-size: 30px;
        font-weight: bold;
        color: #16a34a;
        margin-bottom: 20px;
      }

      .icon {
        font-size: 42px;
        margin-bottom: 10px;
      }

      h2 {
        color: #222;
        margin-bottom: 20px;
      }

      p {
        line-height: 1.6;
        font-size: 15px;
        text-align: left;
      }

      .highlight {
        font-weight: bold;
        color: #16a34a;
      }

      .footer {
        margin-top: 30px;
        padding-top: 20px;
        border-top: 1px solid #eee;
        font-size: 12px;
        color: #888;
        text-align: center;
      }
    </style>
  </head>

  <body>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="logo"> Daan</div>

      <div class="icon"></div>

      <h2>
        Welcome to Daan, <%= name %>!
      </h2>

      <p>
        Thank you for joining
        <span class="highlight">Daan - Donate With Trust</span>.
        Your account has been created successfully.
      </p>

      <p>
        Daan is a trusted platform that connects people who need support
        with generous donors who want to make a meaningful difference.
      </p>

      <p>
        We are happy to have you with us. Together, we can make giving
        more transparent, trusted, and meaningful.
      </p>

      <div class="footer">
        Daan - Donate With Trust<br />
        Connecting hearts through trusted giving.
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>